rbage.','Domestic waste for compost from fruits and vegetables. Woman  throws garbage.','inherit','open','closed','','domestic-waste-for-compost-from-fruits-and-vegetables-woman-throws-garbage','','','2020-08-31 01:01:42','2020-08-31 01:01:42','',0,'http://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-1057790090-1024x1024-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(333,1,'2020-08-31 01:01:45','2020-08-31 01:01:45','','istockphoto-1138136016-1024x1024','closeup of a young caucasian man, on the street, showing a brown cardboard signboard with the text every day is Earth day handwritten in it','inherit','open','closed','','istockphoto-1138136016-1024x1024','','','2020-08-31 01:01:45','2020-08-31 01:01:45','',0,'http://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-1138136016-1024x1024-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(334,1,'2020-08-31 01:01:49','2020-08-31 01:01:49','','istockphoto-1225441483-1024x1024','A large crowd of people wait in line outside a food pantry at St. Bartholomew\'s Roman Catholic Church in Elmhurst, Queens. Catholic charities have played a crucial role during the pandemic, handling a surge in food demand. The Elmhurst neighborhood is one of the hardest hit areas in Queens and has been called \"the epicenter of the epicenter.\" Queens is the largest borough in New York City and one of the most affected by COVID-19.','inherit','open','closed','','istockphoto-1225441483-1024x1024','','','2020-08-31 01:01:49','2020-08-31 01:01:49','',0,'http://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-1225441483-1024x1024-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(335,1,'2020-08-31 01:02:05','2020-08-31 01:02:05','','photo-1559462966-00875a06e3d7','','inherit','open','closed','','photo-1559462966-00875a06e3d7','','','2020-08-31 01:02:05','2020-08-31 01:02:05','',0,'http://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/photo-1559462966-00875a06e3d7.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(336,1,'2020-08-31 01:02:10','2020-08-31 01:02:10','','photo-1540479859555-17af45c78602','','inherit','open','closed','','photo-1540479859555-17af45c78602','','','2020-08-31 01:02:10','2020-08-31 01:02:10','',0,'http://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/photo-1540479859555-17af45c78602.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(337,1,'2020-08-31 01:02:15','2020-08-31 01:02:15','','photo-1542601906990-b4d3fb778b09','','inherit','open','closed','','photo-1542601906990-b4d3fb778b09','','','2020-08-31 01:02:15','2020-08-31 01:02:15','',0,'http://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/photo-1542601906990-b4d3fb778b09.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(338,1,'2020-08-31 01:02:18','2020-08-31 01:02:18','','photo-1569060368645-4ab30c8d8b0e','','inherit','open','closed','','photo-1569060368645-4ab30c8d8b0e','','','2020-08-31 01:02:18','2020-08-31 01:02:18','',0,'http://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/photo-1569060368645-4ab30c8d8b0e.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(339,1,'2020-08-31 01:16:25','2020-08-31 01:16:25','[rev_slider alias=\"home-slider-1\" slidertitle=\"Home-Slider Duplicat\"][/rev_slider]		\n			<h2>We waste a lot of food in Rhode Island\'s schools</h2>		\n			2500		\n		<h4>Tons of wasted food over the school year. That\'s almost 14 tons every day!</h4>		\n			388		\n		<h4>Tons of that wasted food was unopened, untouched and could have been donated.</h4>		\n		<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>And that’s a problem, not only because of the wasted water and energy used to produce and transport food, but also because…</strong></h4>		\n										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"684\" src=\"http://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-1225441483-1024x1024-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-1225441483-1024x1024-1.jpg 1024w, https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-1225441483-1024x1024-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-1225441483-1024x1024-1-768x513.jpg 768w, https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-1225441483-1024x1024-1-700x468.jpg 700w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />											\n		<h4>54,000 Households in RI (12.4%) are food insecure, which means they are often unsure where their next meal will come from due to lack of resources.</h4>		\n		<h4>Most of the food waste from RI schools gets dumped into the Johnston landfill producing methane gas which contributes to global warming. (Methane is many times more powerful a greenhouse gas than Carbon Dioxide)</h4>		\n										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" src=\"http://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/landfill.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/landfill.jpg 1024w, https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/landfill-300x200.jpg 300w, https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/landfill-768x512.jpg 768w, https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/landfill-700x466.jpg 700w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />											\n		<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">We aren\'t going to eliminate all food waste.  But we can do a lot better.</h4>		\n										<img width=\"382\" height=\"427\" src=\"http://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/single-img-4.jpg\" alt=\"m\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/single-img-4.jpg 382w, https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/single-img-4-268x300.jpg 268w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 382px) 100vw, 382px\" />											\n			<h5>SCHOOL FOOD WASTE ESTIMATOR</h5>		\n			<h2>How much food does your School waste?</h2>		\n		<p>We have developed metrics to estimate the amount of food waste your school produces.</p>		\n			<a href=\"#\" role=\"button\">\n						Estimate your Schools Waste\n					</a>\n		<h3>Get Food Smart</h3><h3>RI Challenge!</h3><h6>The RI Schools Recycling Club is challenging your school to Get Food Smart!</h6>		\n			<a href=\"http://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/food-smart/\" role=\"button\">\n						Learn More\n					</a>\n										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"http://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-463374569-1024x1024-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-463374569-1024x1024-1.jpg 1024w, https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-463374569-1024x1024-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-463374569-1024x1024-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https://rischoolsrecyc.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/istockphoto-463374569-1024x1024-1-700x467.jpg 700w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />											\n    <style>.elementor-299 .elementor-element.elementor-element-4c48592d > .elementor-column-wrap > .elementor-widget-wrap > .elementor-widget:not(.elementor-widget__width-auto):not(.elementor-widget__width-initial):not(:last-child):not(.elementor-absolute){margin-bottom:0px;}.elementor-bc-flex-widget .elementor-299 .elementor-element.elementor-element-39d1749e.elementor-column .elementor-column-wrap{align-items:center;}.elementor-299 .elementor-element.elementor-element-39d1749e.elementor-column.elementor-element[data-element_type=\"column\"] > .elementor-column-wrap.elementor-element-populated > .elementor-widget-wrap{align-content:center;align-items:center;}.elementor-299 .elementor-element.elementor-element-39d1749e > .elementor-column-wrap > .elementor-widget-wrap > .elementor-widget:not(.elementor-widget__width-auto):not(.elementor-widget__width-initial):not(:last-child):not(.elementor-absolute){margin-bottom:0px;}.elementor-299 .elementor-element.elementor-